WEBVTT

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:43.090
Wait, why am I in a place like this?

00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:44.150
Excuse me!

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:47.170
Please don't stand there! Please cross the river!

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:50.740
Who are you, lady?

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.220
Hm? I'm Enma. Enma!

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:54.520
Enma?

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:57.920
Hm? Oh, you're from the netherworld!

00:01:57.920 --> 00:01:58.420
Yep!

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:01.070
Well, I'm a magic user right now.

00:02:01.070 --> 00:02:02.160
Then it's Hell for you.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:03.720
What?

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:05.310
Ticket to Hell

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:05.310
He-

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:12.730
Pokaan ~ 11

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:12.300
The Spell of Rebirth Is a Search Through Hell!

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:18.860
Owie...

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:21.510
My butt's done for!

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:22.870
Wait, where am I?

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:26.830
It looks like a pretty brutal place...

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:28.820
Huh?

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:31.130
Why am I stacking rocks?

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.880
Oh well, it looks like everyone else is doin' it too.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.880
But, everyone's so gloomy!

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:42.880
Heh, a new one?

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.390
Okay, last one!

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:50.730
You meanie!

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.480
I just spent all that time stacking them!

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:54.130
That's the expression I'm after!

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:57.190
That's why I just can't quit this job.

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:05.050
This is Children's Limbo.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:07.530
You'll be stacking rocks until the end of time!

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:10.170
Hey you!

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:12.520
Get back to stacking rocks!

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.200
Dammit!

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:17.670
But I can't seem to stop!

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:19.380
Why?

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:24.990
Hey, what the hell are you doing?

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:26.820
I only had one left!

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:31.100
That's it, that's it!

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:34.680
Okay, last one...

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:37.980
Take that!

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:48.030
Hey, you!

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:50.660
Knocking those over is my job!

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:56.540
Hey, listen.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:59.530
I just said, that's my job...

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:00.510
Hey you!

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:05.700
Please stop!

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:12.340
Hey! I was telling you, that's my job!

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.850
H-hey!!

00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:23.030
You... Why don't you just go to Hell!

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:31.570
Ow... my butt, my butt!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:36.540
So you're the one that was causing trouble in Children's Limbo!

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:39.050
Well, ya know...

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:45.540
Well, this cauldron awaits someone as insolent as you!

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:50.060
Hey, wait! What're you gonna do?

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:52.510
This is the hell of the boiling cauldron.

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:55.060
No one's going to save you here!

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:57.060
Whoa, time out, time out!

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:00.270
Throw her in!

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:06.490
Ow, ow, hot hot hot! I give up! I give up!

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:05.480
How is it?

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:06.780
Hot, isn't it?

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:08.780
It hurts, doesn't it?

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:11.290
Aah, I just love hearing cries of suffering!

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.520
Come on! It's getting really hot in here!

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:15.210
Do something about it, quick!

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:18.920
Here ya go.

00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:24.710
What the hell are you thinkin', you octopus!?

00:05:24.710 --> 00:05:25.510
I'll die in here!

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:30.510
Well, it wouldn't be Hell if you could die!

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:31.640
What?

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:36.590
Huh?

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:38.940
What? ...Why?

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:43.220
Well, if I'm not gonna die, there's no point in struggling.

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:44.180
What?

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:46.680
You must really be fighting it on the inside, right?

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:48.950
It's not hot?

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:53.240
Ow! Hot hot hot!

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:54.430
Hm?

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:56.900
Could it that be you don't like hot things?

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.880
What could you mean by that?

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.830
Save me!

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.160
Someone like you...

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:20.690
Just go to Hell!

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:34.490
Ow ow ow ow, my butt, my butt!

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:36.300
Hot, hot, hot!

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:38.000
There's a fire in here!

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:43.050
What? I'm gonna get burned! Someone come quick!

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:43.610
There's no use in trying.

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:45.560
You won't be able to get out of there.

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:48.880
Welcome to the hell of the burning rickshaw!

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:50.220
How is it?

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.010
Hot, no?

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:54.010
"How is it"?! I'm telling you that I'll burn up!

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:57.520
That's the kind of hell this is.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:01.020
Well, I guess I'll burn, but that's about it.

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:02.150
What?

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:05.630
I just heard that you can't die in Hell.

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:08.230
So, what do you do here?

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:15.790
Well... you're surrounded by flames, and as you writhe in pain, you're ferried through Hell...

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:17.160
Then let's go!

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.750
Um...

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:23.010
We'll be leaving now.

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:25.670
Okay! Go, go!

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.560
There's a lot of bad stuff goin' on here, huh?

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:31.240
Of course!

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:35.260
This is a place you're supposed to suffer in, after all!

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:38.180
So please... suffer more!

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:40.690
Hm? There's a portal over there.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:44.190
Out that way is Children's Limbo.

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:47.940
Oh! I'm starting to feel so nostalgic!

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.400
Hey! Demon-san, are you there?

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:54.910
Sup!

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:57.540
Hey, you stay away!

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:59.350
Don't come anywhere near here!

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:01.660
I told you not to bring her here...

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:04.520
Anyway, take her to the next place.

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:05.780
Hurry up!

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:08.170
Jeez... I understand.

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:15.930
We've begun to approach the hell of the boiling cauldron.

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:18.670
Oh, I know this place too!

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:20.930
Hey, Demon-san, are you there?

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:23.940
Sup!

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:26.520
Save me!

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:27.990
Don't come over here, devil!

00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:28.940
What've you come here for?

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:30.740
Touring Hell.

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:34.740
You didn't have to tour this place, so don't bring her here!

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:37.390
Jeez, just go somewhere else!

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:40.240
Okay...

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:44.750
Those guys sure know how to hold a grudge...

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:45.960
Um...

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:46.590
What?

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:48.810
What exactly did you do to them?

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:49.570
Hm?

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:53.470
It's the first time I've ever seen them so frightened.

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:55.760
Well even if you say that...

00:08:55.780 --> 00:09:00.770
Furthermore, you're surrounded by flames but you aren't even suffering...

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:02.510
That's not true!

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:05.300
It's really hot and I'm suffering a lot!

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:05.770
Really!

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:11.250
Then... How about you try going to Heaven?

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:18.780
Then I'm sure you'll realize that Hell is a truly terrible place!

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:20.240
Uh huh...

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:22.240
Okay, let's do it!

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:26.290
I'll write you a note.

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:27.810
Here!

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:44.310
My butt's so comfy now!

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:46.310
Welcome to Heaven.

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:48.340
Oh, thanks...

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:49.690
Let me see that for a second.

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:54.660
Let's see... Huh?!

00:09:56.860 --> 00:10:00.010
Well, then... Let's change your clothes.

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:01.180
Okay.

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:04.920
So, what do they do to you in a place like this?

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:07.710
We don't do anything to you.

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:12.220
This is a place with no conflict, hunger or pain.

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:17.270
A place where the soul is looked after and can rest in peace for eternity.

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:18.940
Ah.

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:21.840
If you have any problems, please don't hesitate to call me.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:23.100
Take care.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.790
Time to roll around!

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:35.520
It's so fluffy...

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:37.030
So comfy!

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:39.790
I could just fall asleep...

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:45.890
Wait a sec! I'm not sleepy at all!

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:48.620
Okay, time to play!

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:53.670
Yay! Whee! Wohoo!

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:09.300
Yipee...

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:14.490
You want to go back?

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:15.570
Yeah.

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:18.130
Are you sure about that?

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:20.690
This is Heaven, after all...

00:11:20.690 --> 00:11:22.280
Yeah, I've had enough.

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:25.780
Hm...

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:28.790
Well, how about I return you to life?

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:30.310
Okay.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:40.420
I'm home.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:32.230
Pokaan ~ 12

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:31.710
A Healing Spell is a Park Debut!

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:32.230
A Healing Spell is a Park Debut

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:36.900
Everyone gathered here, thank you for coming!

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:42.900
The Magical Princess Super Magic Show!

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:46.320
During this short time, please enjoy my magnificent show!

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:03.920
Well then, instead of a regular introduction...

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:07.590
Those who give me strength,

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:09.100
Make these...

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:10.600
Flowers...

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:13.600
bloom everywhere!

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:21.820
Oh my!

00:13:24.310 --> 00:13:26.410
Thank you, thank you!

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:31.410
There she is.

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:37.640
You know, I really didn't think Uma-san would actually do this.

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:40.750
Next is...

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:42.920
Please pay attention to the older man over there.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:53.270
Ugh, this kinda sucks...

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:56.770
Jeez. I just wanna go home...

00:13:56.770 --> 00:14:03.780
Spirits, reverse the flow of time for this man! Nukunuku~, nyokinyoki~!

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:09.100
Now, restore his hair!

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:24.170
Phew... Thank you, thank you!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:25.630
Huh?

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:28.130
There's even more growing!

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:35.100
I didn't get much of a reaction out of that one...

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:38.470
Oh, was that one not that much fun?

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:42.110
Then, I'll do one that's a bit easier to understand!

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:44.870
Jun! Tan! Get the cards ready!

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:56.700
Okay, now, I'll choose one card.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:15:02.500
In this trick, I'll name off the cards, even though I can't see what they are!

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:04.240
Here goes!

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.680
Ears of wind! Eyes of earth!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:16.640
Umm, I've got a feeling this is the wrong spell, but...

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:22.290
Sukesuke~ chirachira~! Sukesuke~ chirachira~! Be revealed to me!

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:29.790
I can see them all. Right on the mark!

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:32.570
Alright then, let's start from this side!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:33.700
Star!

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:35.390
Square!

00:15:38.530 --> 00:15:39.290
Circle!

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:41.060
Cross!

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:47.110
And then... Triangle!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.930
Thank you, thank you!

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:56.110
How was it?

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:58.560
Out of five, I got three right!

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:04.320
Hm? I got three right, you know!

00:16:07.340 --> 00:16:08.250
Dammit.

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:15.700
Okay then, I'll show you an even more amazing trick.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:19.250
I'll change this white handkerchief to blue!

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:20.830
Wouldn't that be amazing?

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:31.480
O shades of blue which traverse through this world…

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:35.260
Blue sky, blue water, blue mountains, become blue!

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:45.650
Look, the color changed!

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.230
This is pathetic...

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:51.800
See? Is it to your liking?

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:53.340
It's a grand success!

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:55.340
A little bit of color has appeared!

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:56.280
Huh...?

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:58.360
What?

00:17:03.090 --> 00:17:04.290
Damn.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:07.800
Um.... then...

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:11.810
I'll let you see an even more amazing spell next.

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:14.300
Today all in attendance get a special bonus.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:18.260
Now, we have these two spoons.

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:23.160
Watch as I bend this one without laying a finger on it!

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:32.610
All things with shape must bend one day, poki, kunya, paki, bend with the force of my emotions!

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:38.780
Look! It's bending! It's a success!

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:41.510
Please observe!

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:47.380
It's a miracle! They've bent!

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:49.840
You all can see this quite clearly, right?

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:55.680
What is she doing?

00:17:55.680 --> 00:17:57.570
I wish she'd go somewhere else.

00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:58.340
Ow!

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:00.480
Over there!

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:02.480
Stop whispering!

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:07.280
Why? What do you not like about this?

00:18:07.300 --> 00:18:08.850
This is magic!

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:11.390
You're watching miracles happen!

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:14.150
Miraculous, magical, wonderful, isn't it?

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:27.760
The Magical Princess Super Magic Show?

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:29.920
Magic?

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:45.430
Um... The sign's wrong.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:49.440
The Magical Princess Super Magic Show!

00:18:46.280 --> 00:18:49.440
It shouldn't be "magic", but "magical"...

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:52.100
"Magic" is just sleight of hand...

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:56.190
You know, I'm not a magician!

00:18:56.610 --> 00:18:58.580
I'm a magical princess!

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.510
I'm a sorceress!

00:19:01.270 --> 00:19:02.450
Um...

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:05.440
Pachira was the one that wrote this sign...

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:08.350
Pachira!

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:13.540
You shouldn't worry about a little mistake like that.

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:15.960
You get pissed about the smallest things, even though you're a princess!

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:17.810
Oh, she's right.

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:19.810
The sign is wrong.

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:23.310
I tried so hard...

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:28.480
I tried so hard at my big debut in the park!

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:31.980
Pachira, you idiot!

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:36.100
Now you've made me really angry!

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:38.990
Mukamuka appuchin~! Mukamuka appuchin~!

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:47.450
Uma-san, your panties are showing...

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:15.220
What?

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:17.860
Was it the lightning?

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:22.610
Mukamuka appuchin~! Mukamuka~ appuchin~! Pachira, you moron!

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:37.910
Encore, encore!

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:41.910
Huh? What? But no lightning came down... Is that okay?

00:20:54.590 --> 00:21:00.190
I don't really get it, but... Mukamuka appuchin~! Pachira, you moron!

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:10.530
She didn't have to hit me with lightning and call me and idiot just for that...

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:15.210
Hm? Pachira-san, when did you get so burned?

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:18.670
Thanks, everyone!

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:20.260
Yeah!

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:23.730
I'll be back tomorrow, so please come!

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:25.590
Okay!

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:27.530
It's a promise!

00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:29.230
Okay!

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:31.570
It's a promise!

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:33.230
Okay!

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:36.850
The
next day

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:47.820
Hm? Uma, why are you still here?

00:21:49.140 --> 00:21:50.730
What about the park?

00:21:50.730 --> 00:21:51.870
Too much trouble.

00:22:05.180 --> 00:22:07.740
These guys are sketchy.

00:23:39.610 --> 00:23:41.690
You've pretended to be someone else before, haven't you?

00:23:41.930 --> 00:23:44.100
Just playing, or make believe of some sort.

00:23:44.100 --> 00:23:46.100
It makes you stop on a whim.

00:23:46.100 --> 00:23:48.520
Afterwards, you're really going to regret it!
